    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'Robgoblin Adept Trouble! (FR Battle)' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/Robgoblin_Adept_Trouble_FR_Battle.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. It replaces every earlier note in this record about the prize wheel or its prizes."}
